 "s03/kich-thuoc": "$ evtx-dau mau/*.evtx\n2-system-Microsoft-Windows-Live... ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  16 (đầu 14, cuối  13)  bản ghi kế #2394      cờ 0x1 DIRTY\n2-system-Security-dirty.evtx       ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng 180 (đầu  0, cuối 179)  bản ghi kế #14427     cờ 0x1 DIRTY\n2-vss_0-Microsoft-Windows-Termi... ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  16 (đầu 10, cuối   9)  bản ghi kế #308335    cờ 0x1 DIRTY\n2-vss_7-System.evtx                ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng   4 (đầu  0, cuối   3)  bản ghi kế #371       cờ 0x1 DIRTY\nApplication.evtx                   ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  50 (đầu  0, cuối  49)  bản ghi kế #6166      cờ 0x1 DIRTY\nArchive-ForwardedEvents-test.evtx  ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  66 (đầu  0, cuối  65)  bản ghi kế #127639584 cờ 0x0\ndbc-many-events-application.evtx   ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  21 (đầu  0, cuối  20)  bản ghi kế #2217      cờ 0x0\ndbc-many-events-security.evtx      ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng 158 (đầu  0, cuối 157)  bản ghi kế #13224     cờ 0x0\ndbc-many-events-system.evtx        ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  60 (đầu  0, cuối  59)  bản ghi kế #8415      cờ 0x0\ndefender-1116-1117.evtx            ElfFile v3.2  chunk dùng   1 (đầu  0, cuối   0)  bản ghi kế #7         cờ 0x0\ndefender-1151.evtx                 ElfFile v3.2  chunk dùng  23 (đầu  0, cuối  22)  bản ghi kế #456       cờ 0x0\nfirewall-2004.evtx                 ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng   1 (đầu  0, cuối   0)  bản ghi kế #2         cờ 0x0\npowershell-openssh-install.evtx    ElfFile v3.2  chunk dùng   1 (đầu  0, cuối   0)  bản ghi kế #31        cờ 0x0\nsecurity_big_sample.evtx           ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng 481 (đầu  0, cuối 480)  bản ghi kế #289157    cờ 0x0\nsecurity.evtx                      ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng  26 (đầu  0, cuối  25)  bản ghi kế #2226      cờ 0x1 DIRTY\nsysmon.evtx                        ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng   1 (đầu  0, cuối   0)  bản ghi kế #1742      cờ 0x1 DIRTY\nsystem.evtx                        ElfFile v3.1  chunk dùng   3 (đầu  0, cuối   2)  bản ghi kế #309       cờ 0x1 DIRTY\nPS> Get-ChildItem mau/*.evtx | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Tep = $_.Name.Substring(0,[math]::Min(34,$_.Name.Length)); Byte = $_.Length; 'Tru 4096, chia 65536' = ($_.Length - 4096) / 65536 } } | Format-Table -AutoSize\nTep                                    Byte Tru 4096, chia 65536\n---                                    ---- --------------------\n2-system-Microsoft-Windows-LiveId%  1052672                   16\n2-system-Security-dirty.evtx       12652544                  193\n2-vss_0-Microsoft-Windows-Terminal  1052672                   16\n2-vss_7-System.evtx                 1118208                   17\nApplication.evtx                    4198400                   64\nArchive-ForwardedEvents-test.evtx   4329472                   66\ndbc-many-events-application.evtx    2166784                   33\ndbc-many-events-security.evtx      10555392                  161\ndbc-many-events-system.evtx         4263936                   65\ndefender-1116-1117.evtx               69632                    1\ndefender-1151.evtx                  2166784                   33\nfirewall-2004.evtx                    69632                    1\npowershell-openssh-install.evtx       69632                    1\nsecurity_big_sample.evtx           31526912                  481\nsecurity.evtx                       2166784                   33\nsysmon.evtx                         1118208                   17\nsystem.evtx                         1118208                   17\nPS> $r = evtx-rec mau/security_big_sample.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json; $a = ($r.t | Measure-Object -Minimum -Maximum); $gio = ($a.Maximum - $a.Minimum).TotalHours; $mb = (Get-Item mau/security_big_sample.evtx).Length / 1MB; \"{0:N0} su kien | {1:N1} MB | tu {2:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm} den {3:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm} UTC = {4:N1} gio\" -f $r.Count, $mb, $a.Minimum, $a.Maximum, $gio; \"{0:N0} su kien/gio | ~{1:N0} byte/su kien | 20 MB chua duoc ~{2:N1} gio\" -f ($r.Count/$gio), ((Get-Item mau/security_big_sample.evtx).Length/$r.Count), ($gio*20/$mb)\n62,031 su kien | 30.1 MB | tu 2016-10-06 01:47 den 2016-10-07 09:38 UTC = 31.9 gio\n1,947 su kien/gio | ~508 byte/su kien | 20 MB chua duoc ~21.2 gio\nPS> evtx-rec mau/security_big_sample.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | Group-Object id | Sort-Object Count -Descending | Select-Object -First 8 Count,@{n='Id';e={$_.Name}},@{n='PhanTram';e={'{0:P0}' -f ($_.Count/62031)}} | Format-Table -AutoSize\nCount Id   PhanTram\n----- --   --------\n22517 5156 36%\n 9310 5152 15%\n 8488 5158 14%\n 8312 5157 13%\n 3648 4624 6%\n 3642 4634 6%\n 2814 4672 5%\n 1537 5140 2%\n$ evtx-rec mau/2-system-Security-dirty.evtx mau/sysmon.evtx 'mau/2-vss_0-Microsoft-Windows-TerminalServices-RemoteConnectionManager%4Operational.evtx' 2>&1 >/dev/null | cut -c1-160\n[evtx-rec] mau/sysmon.evtx: bỏ qua bản ghi hỏng — Failed to parse chunk number 9: Failed to parse chunk header: Invalid EVTX chunk header ma\n[evtx-rec] mau/sysmon.evtx: bỏ qua bản ghi hỏng — Failed to parse chunk number 10: Failed to parse chunk header: Invalid EVTX chunk header m\n[evtx-rec] mau/sysmon.evtx: bỏ qua bản ghi hỏng — Failed to parse chunk number 11: Failed to parse chunk header: Invalid EVTX chunk header m\n[evtx-rec] mau/sysmon.evtx: tổng 8 bản ghi/chunk hỏng bị bỏ qua\n[evtx-rec] mau/2-vss_0-Microsoft-Windows-TerminalServices-RemoteConnectionManager%4Operational.evtx: bỏ qua bản ghi hỏng — Failed to parse record number\n[evtx-rec] mau/2-vss_0-Microsoft-Windows-TerminalServices-RemoteConnectionManager%4Operational.evtx: bỏ qua bản ghi hỏng — Failed to read the record at\n[evtx-rec] mau/2-vss_0-Microsoft-Windows-TerminalServices-RemoteConnectionManager%4Operational.evtx: tổng 2 bản ghi/chunk hỏng bị bỏ qua\nPS> evtx-rec mau/2-system-Security-dirty.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | Group-Object may | Select-Object Count,Name | Format-Table -AutoSize; evtx-rec mau/2-system-Security-dirty.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object id -in 1100,1102,1104,1105,4608,4616 | Sort-Object rec | Select-Object -First 9 @{n='UTC';e={$_.t.ToString('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss')}},id,may | Format-Table -AutoSize\nCount Name\n----- ----\n14495 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n  126 WIN-LL0C19JS506\n\n\nUTC                   id may\n---                   -- ---\n2018-07-28 07:24:49 4608 WIN-LL0C19JS506\n2018-07-28 07:27:15 1100 WIN-LL0C19JS506\n2018-07-28 07:27:31 4608 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n2018-07-28 00:36:44 4616 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n2018-07-28 00:36:44 4616 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n2018-07-28 01:06:39 1100 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n2018-07-28 01:06:39 4616 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n2018-07-28 01:07:05 4608 DESKTOP-0QT8017\n2018-07-28 01:09:54 1100 DESKTOP-0QT8017",
